    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d325">

                <pb facs="0483" n="395" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg395"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/3795e: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to
                        Queen Marie of Roumania</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-06">December 6,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your Majesty’s message<anchor n="16" xml:id="d325-f1"/> has given the deepest
                    pleasure, and I beg to assure you that it has been and always will be considered
                    a privilege by the American people and government to do whatever is possible by
                    way of friendly assistance to the people of Roumania.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
